# A *delta document* applied on top of `sulo.ofn` by
# `tests/common/mod.rs::load_fixture_pair`.
#
# It mentions two class IRIs absent from sulo, so lowering it through
# `convert_delta` interns two FRESH ClassIds directly above sulo's user
# vocabulary - i.e. into the reserved slack gap. That is the whole point of the
# fixture: `SaturationState::apply_additions` must absorb the new classes
# without rebuilding, which is only possible while they fit under `synth_base`.
Prefix(:=<http://rustdl.test/new#>)
Prefix(sulo:=<https://w3id.org/sulo/>)
Ontology(<http://rustdl.test/sulo-new-class>
Declaration(Class(:Widget))
Declaration(Class(:Gadget))
SubClassOf(:Widget sulo:Object)
SubClassOf(:Gadget ObjectIntersectionOf(:Widget ObjectSomeValuesFrom(sulo:hasPart sulo:Quality)))
)
